    "body": "Thank you for this request and the clear list of differences.\n\nTriage: `enhancement`, `P6` (accepted, not scheduled), `effort:high` (a post changes the G-code that drives the machine, so it is never lower), `area:post`.\n\nClaim recorded for @HansFel - label and assignee set (only collaborators can set labels; your comment is the claim).\n\nClean-room limit: use only the public control documentation, as you wrote. Do not read or adapt posts from Fusion 360, HSMWorks or other CAM products, not even to compare output.\n\nWhat would help most after the PR: a safe air-cut of the goldens on a real controller (spindle off, Z high), with a note of any line that the control refuses or reads differently.\n",
